-other-states\",\"text\":\"How Texas Compares to Other States\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"texas-vs-california\",\"text\":\"Texas vs. California\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-vs-new-york\",\"text\":\"Texas vs. New York\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"the-bottom-line-on-texas-taxes\",\"text\":\"The Bottom Line on Texas Taxes\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"texas-income-tax-the-complete-picture\",\"text\":\"Texas Income Tax: The Complete Picture\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"texas-income-tax-rate-2025-vs-2026\",\"text\":\"Texas Income Tax Rate 2025 vs 2026\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-much-is-your-salary-after-taxes-in-texas\",\"text\":\"How Much Is Your Salary After Taxes in Texas?\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"100-000-after-taxes-in-texas\",\"text\":\"$$100,000 After Taxes in Texas\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"200-000-after-taxes-in-texas\",\"text\":\"$$200,000 After Taxes in Texas\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"other-common-salaries-after-taxes-in-texas\",\"text\":\"Other Common Salaries After Taxes in Texas\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"25-an-hour-after-taxes-in-texas\",\"text\":\"$$25 an Hour After Taxes in Texas\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-rates-cars-and-permits\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax: Rates, Cars, and Permits\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-rate\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax Rate\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-on-cars\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax on Cars\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-permit-and-login\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax Permit and Login\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-exemption\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax Exemption\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"texas-sales-tax-rate-2025-vs-2026\",\"text\":\"Texas Sales Tax Rate 2025 vs 2026\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"frequently-asked-questions-about-texas-taxes\",\"text\":\"Frequently Asked Questions About Texas Taxes\",\"level\":2},{\"id\":\"does-texas-have-income-tax\",\"text\":\"Does Texas have income tax?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"what-is-the-income-tax-rate-in-texas\",\"text\":\"What is the income tax rate in Texas?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-much-is-100-000-taxed-in-texas\",\"text\":\"How much is $100,000 taxed in Texas?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"is-tax-8-25-in-texas\",\"text\":\"Is tax 8.25% in Texas?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-much-tax-is-on-100-in-texas\",\"text\":\"How much tax is on $100 in Texas?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"what-is-the-sales-tax-on-a-30-000-car-in-texas\",\"text\":\"What is the sales tax on a $30,000 car in Texas?\",\"level\":3},{\"id\":\"how-do-texas-taxes-compare-to-other-states\",\"text\":\"How do Texas taxes compare to other states?\",\"level\":3}]}]}]}],\"$L28\"]}],\"$L29\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Author: Rachel Mitchell\",\"className\":\"rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/5 to-card/80 p-5 sm:p-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"img\",null,{\"src\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\",\"alt\":\"Rachel Mitchell, CPA\",\"width\":48,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-emerald-500/30\",\"loading\":\"lazy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L11\",null,{\"href\":\"/about#rachel-mitchell\",\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-md bg-emerald-500/15 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/25\",\"children\":\"CPA\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-0.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[\"Lead Tax Analyst & Editorial Director\",\", TheTaxCalc\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Rachel Mitchell is a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) licensed in Illinois with over 12 years of experience in individual and small-business taxation. She specializes in federal and state income tax compliance, FICA optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center gap-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"h-3 w-3 text-emerald-500/60\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"d\":\"M6.75 3v2.25M17.25 3v2.25M3 18.75V7.5a2.25 2.25 0 012.25-2.25h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 7.5v11.25m-18 0A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 18.75m-18 0v-7.5A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 9h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 11.25v7.5\"}]}],\"Reviewed: January 2026\"]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"Tax data verified against IRS Publication 15-T & state revenue departments\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-8 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/5 p-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-bold text-foreground mb-3\",\"children\":\"Try Our Tax Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"See exactly how much you'll take home after all taxes and deductions.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":